Error [jet.CasingMismatch]: Local `_0` must be snake_case
  --> tests/ui/casing_underscore_digit.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     _0: 7
    |     ^^
 Why: Jet enforces PascalCase for type-like names, snake_case for value-like names, and ALL_CAPS (SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE) for module-global constants
 Fix: Rename it to a word: a leading underscore followed by a digit is not a valid binding name
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0357
